---
layout: base.njk
title: Wivey Talks
description: A programme of talks on subjects of general and community interest in Wiveliscombe.
---

<header class="hero" data-variant="page">
  <h1>Wivey Talks</h1>
  <p class="lede">A programme of talks on subjects of general and community interest in Wiveliscombe.</p>
</header>

<section class="section flow">
  <div class="talk-info">
    <p>All talks are at St Andrew's Church, Wiveliscombe and start at 7:30pm. Doors open 7:00pm.</p>

    <p>Admission free to members with annual subscriptions of &pound;12 per person or &pound;16 for two people at the same address. Visitors &pound;5.</p>

    <p>We welcome feedback on our talks including suggestions for future topics.</p>
    <p>You can also access a poster archive for talks in previous seasons:
      <a href="#">2023-2024</a> and
      <a href="#">2024-2025</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="talk-list-heading">Upcoming Talks</h2>

  <div class="talk-list">
    {% for talk in collections.talks %}
    <article>
      <img
        src="{{ talk.data.image }}-800.jpg"
        srcset="{{ talk.data.image }}-400.jpg 400w,
                {{ talk.data.image }}-800.jpg 800w,
                {{ talk.data.image }}-1200.jpg 1200w"
        sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 18rem, (min-width: 36rem) 30vw, min(100vw, 20rem)"
        width="800" height="800"
        alt="{{ talk.data.imageAlt or '' }}"
        loading="lazy">
      <div>
        <p>
          <time datetime="{{ talk.data.date }}">{{ talk.data.date | displayTalkDate }}</time>
          {{ talk.data.time }}
        </p>
        <h3><a href="{{ talk.url }}">{{ talk.data.title }}</a></h3>
        {% if talk.data.byline %}
        <p>{{ talk.data.byline }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="{{ talk.url }}">More details</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
